"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"제어를","x":666,"y":1104,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"넘긴다.","x":778,"y":1104,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"다른","x":900,"y":1105,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"작업의","x":979,"y":1105,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"경우","x":1096,"y":1105,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"장치","x":1174,"y":1106,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"드라이버는","x":1256,"y":1106,"width":176,"height":39},{"text":"“쓰기","x":1445,"y":1105,"width":81,"height":39},{"text":"완료”","x":1544,"y":1105,"width":85,"height":38},{"text":"또","x":1643,"y":1113,"width":33,"height":27}]},{"text":"는 “장치 A卜\u0026 중하 같은 상태 정보를 반환한다. 그러나 컨트롤러는 장치 드라이버에게","words":[{"text":"는","x":328,"y":1173,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"“장치","x":376,"y":1171,"width":76,"height":40},{"text":"A卜\u0026","x":470,"y":1171,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"중하","x":548,"y":1170,"width":81,"height":39},{"text":"같은","x":641,"y":1170,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"상태","x":720,"y":1169,"width":63,"height":40},{"text":"정보를","x":801,"y":1169,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"반환한다.","x":915,"y":1169,"width":141,"height":40},{"text":"그러나","x":1072,"y":1171,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"컨트롤러는","x":1192,"y":1171,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"장치","x":1377,"y":1171,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"드라이버에게","x":1463,"y":1170,"width":210,"height":43}]},{"text":"작업을 완료했다는 사실을 어떻게 알리는가? 이는 인터럽트를 통해 이루어진다.","words":[{"text":"작업을","x":328,"y":1236,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"완료했다는","x":440,"y":1236,"width":166,"height":39},{"text":"사실을","x":617,"y":1235,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"어떻게","x":730,"y":1235,"width":95,"height":40},{"text":"알리는가?","x":841,"y":1235,"width":149,"height":39},{"text":"이는","x":1006,"y":1235,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"인터럽트를","x":1087,"y":1236,"width":169,"height":39},{"text":"통해","x":1268,"y":1236,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"이루어진다.","x":1353,"y":1236,"width":183,"height":39}]},{"text":"1.2.1.1 개요 Ovemew","words":[{"text":"1.2.1.1","x":328,"y":1362,"width":100,"height":28},{"text":"개요","x":467,"y":1357,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"Ovemew","x":554,"y":1367,"width":145,"height":23}]},{"text":"하드웨어는 어느 순간이든 시스템 버스를 통해 CPU에 신호를 보내 인터럽트를 발생시","words":[{"text":"하드웨어는","x":329,"y":1438,"width":169,"height":41},{"text":"어느","x":512,"y":1438,"width":63,"height":40},{"text":"순간이든","x":587,"y":1438,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"시스템","x":734,"y":1437,"width":95,"height":40},{"text":"버스를","x":848,"y":1438,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"통해","x":960,"y":1438,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"CPU에","x":1042,"y":1438,"width":113,"height":39},{"text":"신호를","x":1174,"y":1438,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"보내","x":1291,"y":1437,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"인터럽트를","x":1378,"y":1437,"width":177,"height":39},{"text":"발생시","x":1570,"y":1437,"width":100,"height":40}]},{"text":"길 수 있다. (컴퓨터 시스템에는 많은 버스가 있을 수 있지만 시스템 버스는 주요 구성요","words":[{"text":"길","x":332,"y":1504,"width":30,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":376,"y":1505,"width":34,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":424,"y":1505,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"(컴퓨터","x":510,"y":1505,"width":106,"height":42},{"text":"시스템에는","x":633,"y":1504,"width":164,"height":40},{"text":"많은","x":809,"y":1504,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"버스가","x":889,"y":1503,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"있을","x":1005,"y":1503,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1082,"y":1504,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있지만","x":1132,"y":1503,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"시스템","x":1247,"y":1503,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"버스는","x":1366,"y":1503,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"주요","x":1483,"y":1504,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"구성요","x":1569,"y":1504,"width":105,"height":38}]},{"text":"소 사이의 주요 통신 경로이다.) 인터럽트는 다른 많은 목적으로도 시용되며 운영체제와","words":[{"text":"소","x":329,"y":1573,"width":35,"height":29},{"text":"사이의","x":377,"y":1570,"width":96,"height":40},{"text":"주요","x":489,"y":1573,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"통신","x":566,"y":1570,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"경로이다.)","x":646,"y":1570,"width":150,"height":42},{"text":"인터럽트는","x":813,"y":1569,"width":166,"height":39},{"text":"다른","x":992,"y":1569,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"많은","x":1073,"y":1569,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"목적으로도","x":1153,"y":1569,"width":175,"height":39},{"text":"시용되며","x":1342,"y":1568,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"운영체제와","x":1497,"y":1568,"width":179,"height":40}]},{"text":"하드웨어의 상호 작용 방식의 핵심 부분이다.","words":[{"text":"하드웨어의","x":329,"y":1636,"width":165,"height":40},{"text":"상호","x":508,"y":1637,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"작용","x":585,"y":1637,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"방식의","x":663,"y":1636,"width":94,"height":39},{"text":"핵심","x":774,"y":1636,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"부분이다.","x":850,"y":1636,"width":142,"height":39}]},{"text":"CPU가 인터럽트 되면, CPU는 하던 일을 중단하고 즉시 고정된 위치로 실행을 옮","words":[{"text":"CPU가","x":389,"y":1702,"width":117,"height":39},{"text":"인터럽트","x":520,"y":1702,"width":128,"height":39},{"text":"되면,","x":664,"y":1702,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"CPU는","x":751,"y":1704,"width":115,"height":36},{"text":"하던","x":879,"y":1702,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"일을","x":963,"y":1702,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"중단하고","x":1041,"y":1702,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"즉시","x":1192,"y":1702,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"고정된","x":1277,"y":1701,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"위치로","x":1399,"y":1701,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"실행을","x":1520,"y":1700,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"옮","x":1639,"y":1700,"width":35,"height":38}]},{"text":"긴다. 이러한 고정된 위치는 일반적으로 인터럽트를 위한 서비스 루틴이 위치한 시작 주","words":[{"text":"긴다.","x":325,"y":1767,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"이러한","x":416,"y":1768,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"고정된","x":526,"y":1768,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"위치는","x":640,"y":1768,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"일반적으로","x":754,"y":1768,"width":164,"height":39},{"text":"인터럽트를","x":934,"y":1768,"width":168,"height":40},{"text":"위한","x":1116,"y":1769,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"서비스","x":1198,"y":1768,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"루틴이","x":1314,"y":1767,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"위치한","x":1436,"y":1767,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"시작","x":1557,"y":1766,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"주","x":1640,"y":1768,"width":35,"height":37}]},{"text":"소를 가지고 있다. 그리고 인터럽트 서비스 루틴이 실행된다. 인터럽트 서비스 루틴의","words":[{"text":"소를","x":321,"y":1835,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"가지고","x":407,"y":1834,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":525,"y":1833,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"그리고","x":614,"y":1834,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"인터럽트","x":733,"y":1834,"width":131,"height":40},{"text":"서비스","x":882,"y":1835,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"루틴이","x":999,"y":1834,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"실행된다.","x":1120,"y":1833,"width":144,"height":41},{"text":"인터럽트","x":1287,"y":1833,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"서비스","x":1445,"y":1833,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"루틴의","x":1569,"y":1832,"width":102,"height":40}]},{"text":"실행이 완료되면, CPU는 인터럽트 되었던 연산을 재개한다. 이러한 연산의 시간 일정","words":[{"text":"실행이","x":320,"y":1900,"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"완료되면,","x":436,"y":1900,"width":141,"height":40},{"text":"CPU는","x":593,"y":1903,"width":115,"height":36},{"text":"인터럽트","x":725,"y":1901,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"되었던","x":873,"y":1901,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"연산을","x":992,"y":1901,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"재개한다.","x":1107,"y":1901,"width":145,"height":39},{"text":"이러한","x":1273,"y":1900,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"연산의","x":1396,"y":1900,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"시간","x":1518,"y":1899,"width":73,"height":40},{"text":"일정","x":1608,"y":1899,"width":63,"height":39}]},{"text":"(time line)이 그림 1.3에 있다. 이 그림과 관련된 애니메이션을 실행하려면 여기를 클","words":[{"text":"(time","x":318,"y":1970,"width":88,"height":40},{"text":"line)이","x":422,"y":1968,"width":106,"height":43},{"text":"그림","x":546,"y":1968,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"1.3에","x":628,"y":1968,"width":78,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":726,"y":1968,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":816,"y":1967,"width":28,"height":40},{"text":"그림과"